      "writtenOn": "2023-12-28T16:56:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The non AP_PWRSEQ_DRIVER version waits while `((RSMRST \u003d\u003d 0) \u0026\u0026 (SLP_SUS \u003d\u003d 0))`.  This version waits while `((RSMRST \u003d\u003d 1) \u0026\u0026 (SLP_SUS \u003d\u003d 0))`.  Which is correct?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 157,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 159,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "205a300fbbe10d29ec6f1045a9ee484dc01b612d",
